<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#游奕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时魏官吏。景初二年（238），为南安太守，将兵讨蜀阴平太守廖惇，为惇所破。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹邕> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹邕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹邕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹邕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹邕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹邕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏王公。曹丕之子。黄初二年（221），封淮南公，以九江郡为国。三年，进为淮南王。四年，改封陈。六年，改封邯郸。太和三年（229）卒，谥曰怀王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘望之> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘望之"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘望之> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉望之"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘望之> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘望之> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为荆州牧刘表从事。后因正言直谏，佞人谗害，为刘表所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕产> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吕产"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕产> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吕産"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕产> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕产> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "表字不详。秦末和西汉初人物，汉高祖皇后吕雉的侄子。吕雉死后，诸吕叛乱，周勃派刘章领兵进宫，杀掉吕产。及后诸吕势力很快就被周勃等人铲除。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕产> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西汉时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜阳> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜阳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜阳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "杜陽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜阳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜阳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初平中，任河阴令。其外甥韩浩为河内太守王匡从事，率兵拒董卓于盟津。董卓乃执阳，使招降韩浩，为韩浩所拒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘璩> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘璩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘璩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉璩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘璩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘璩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "后主刘禅第七子。又名虔。后主景耀二年（259），立为上党王。魏咸熙元年（264），蜀亡，随后主东迁洛阳。约死于西晋永嘉（307-313）大乱中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿况> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "耿况"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿况> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "侠游"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿况> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿况> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "以明经为郎，与王莽从弟王伋共学《老子》于安丘先生。后归刘秀，封隃麋侯。卒谥烈。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程远志> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "程远志"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程远志> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "程遠誌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程远志> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程远志> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程远志> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "黄巾军将领，于三国演义第1回登场，统兵五万进犯涿郡。幽州刺史刘焉令校尉邹靖引刘备、关羽、张飞三人，统兵五百，前去破敌。在大兴山下，两军交战，程远志被关羽一刀挥为两段，余众溃散。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贺循> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "贺循"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贺循> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彦先"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贺循> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贺循> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父邵为孙皓所杀，流放临海。吴平，还乡里。举秀才，授阳羡、武康令。久之，召为太子舍人。司马睿为镇东将军，请循为军司马；及为晋王，以循为中书令，固让不受，转太常，领太子太傅。循好学博闻，尤善《三礼》，时朝廷初建，动有疑议，宗庙制度皆循所定..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张纲> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张纲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张纲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文纪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张纲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张纲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少以三公子经明行修，举孝廉，不就；司徒辟，以高第为侍御史。顺帝汉安元年（142），拜光禄大夫，诏令持节案行天下贪廉。纲以为“豺狼当路，安问狐狸”，遂停留洛阳都亭不去，上书条列梁冀等无君之心十五事。顺帝知纲言不诬，然无心治冀。冀深恨纲。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关平> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "关平"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "關平"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "关羽长子。曹公遣徐晃救曹仁，羽不能克樊城，引军退还。权已据江陵，尽虏羽士众妻子，羽军遂散。权遣将逆击羽，斩羽及子平于临沮。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "关羽义子。原关定次子、关宁之弟，自幼学武。跟随关羽南征北战，屡立功劳，多与刘封搭档。曾与庞德大战三十合，不分胜负。关羽败走麦城之际，关平跟随，一同被捕，遭孙权杀害，父子归神。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙奕> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙奕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙奕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫奕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙奕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙奕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙韶之子。韶死，孙奕被任命为宗正卿。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王忠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王忠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王忠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少为亭长。在关中乱时，他因饥饿以人为食，南往武关逃难；率死党袭击了为刘表招纳人士的娄子伯，得兵千人，投奔了曹操。每从征伐，五官将用冢间骷髅悬忠马鞍，以为欢笑。后与刘岱攻沛，没攻下。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "与刘岱共同防守徐州的刘备，但被关羽擒获。放走后，在许昌将要被曹操下令处死时，多亏孔融求情才被饶了性命。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乌伦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "乌伦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乌伦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "烏倫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乌伦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乌伦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "鲜卑首领。鲜卑入侵边境，汉遣度辽将军邓遵等出塞追击，破之，鲜卑大人乌伦降汉，被封为王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#唐蹏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "唐蹏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#唐蹏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "唐蹏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#唐蹏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#唐蹏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时魏陇西羌族首领。太和二年（228）为魏将郭淮讨破。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘琳> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘琳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘琳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉林"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘琳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘琳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘劭子。齐王芳正始（240-249）中，其父卒。嗣为关内侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王宏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王宏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王宏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "正宗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王宏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王宏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "王业之子，王弼之兄。魏时辟公府，迁尚书郎，历给事中。晋武帝泰始初，为汲郡太守，有治绩。后迁卫尉、河南尹、大司农。太康中，代刘毅为司隶校尉。五年（284）卒，追赠太常。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宕蕈> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "宕蕈"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宕蕈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "宕蕈"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宕蕈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宕蕈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "守善羌侯。明帝景初二年（238），蜀阴平太守廖惇反，攻其营。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴宪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "裴宪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "景思"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "裴楷子。少而颖悟，修儒学。初侍讲东宫，历黄门吏部郎、侍中。王浚承制以为尚书。永嘉末，王浚为石勒所败，枣嵩等大臣莫不谢罪军门，裴宪恬然不出。石勒素重其名。待以宾礼。署从事中郎，出为长乐太守。后为光禄大夫、司徒、太傅。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左悺> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "左悺"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左悺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "左悺"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左悺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左悺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "宦官。桓帝时为中常侍，封上蔡侯。专横跋扈，肆行酷烈，为司隶校尉韩演劾奏，自杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左悺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司空曹操，祖父中常侍腾，与左棺、徐璜并作妖孽，饕餮放横，伤化虐民。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魁头> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "魁头"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魁头> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "魁頭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魁头> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魁头> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末鲜卑人首领。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘固> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘固"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘固> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉固"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘固> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘固> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时魏官吏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄温> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "甄温"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄温> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲舒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄温> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄温> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "甄像之子。字仲舒。魏太和三年（229），以明帝舅氏之后受封为列侯。入晋，进为辅国大将军，加侍中，领射声校尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙松> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙松"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙松> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子乔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙松> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙松> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权之侄，孙翊之子。为人轻财好施，善与人交。陆逊、诸葛亮皆与之友善。曾任射声校尉，都乡侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟峻> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "钟峻"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟峻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鍾峻"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟峻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟峻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "钟繇孙，为钟会所养。元帝咸熙元年（264），钟会谋叛被杀，峻下狱，当伏诛，蒙赦。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘彦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘彦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘彦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉彦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘彦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘彦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾为交州小吏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙秀> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙秀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙秀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "俊忠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙秀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙秀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "起自瑯琊外史，以谄媚为赵王伦所宠，与伦同谋废贾后，逼惠帝禅位。司马伦僭位后，任秀为侍中、中书监。伦庸凡无能，复受制于秀。孙秀多杀忠良，黄门侍郎潘岳即被他杀。秀威权振朝廷。齐王冏等起兵讨伦，秀被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王祚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王祚"@zh .
