<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祝奥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祝奥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末义军首领郭援的谋士。曾中贾逵之计，劝援缓攻皮氏七日，延误了战机。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀衢> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀衢"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀衢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "荀衢"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀衢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀衢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "荀昙之子，荀攸叔父。昙卒，故吏张权求守墓，攸以为有奸，告衢。衢感悟，推问张权，果杀人亡命。衢由是对攸刮目相看。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#管邈> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "管邈"@zh .
