<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#管邈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "管宁之子。拜郎中，后为博士。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郤俭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郤俭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郤俭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郤儉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郤俭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郤俭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "方士。传说能辟谷，食茯苓。绝食百日，而尚能行步起居自若云。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王布> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王布"@zh .
