<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王布> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "寿春将王布示之马射，既而问之曰：“吴之君子亦能斯乎？”陟曰：“此军人骑士肄业所及，士大夫君子未有为之者矣。”布大惭。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈正> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈正"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈正> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陳正"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈正> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈正> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权末年，任无难督。时孙权欲废太子孙和而立孙亮，上书谏止，遭族诛。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王延> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王延"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王延"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "王蕃弟。蕃死，孙皓迁蕃家属至广州。郭马反，延不为马用，被害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李邵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李邵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李邵"@zh .
