<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任冀州刺史。关东讨董卓兵起，他不从司马朗劝，徙居温县，使边山之民内徙后发生变乱。后任钜鹿太守，隶冀州牧袁绍。初平三年（192），袁绍与公孙瓒战于界桥（今河北威县东），他以公孙瓒兵强，欲附瓒。袁绍遂以董昭领钜鹿，去其职。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹潜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹潜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹潜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹潜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹潜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹潜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏王公。相殇王铄之子。青龙元年（233），潜嗣爵。其年卒，谥曰愍王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#种邵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "种邵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#种邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "申甫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#种邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#种邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少知名。中平末为谏议大夫。献帝初从侍中出为益、涼二州刺史。会父死，不之职。与马腾等共攻李傕、郭汜，军败，邵等皆死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#种邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西凉太守马腾、并州刺史韩遂，杀奔长安来，声言讨贼。李傕、郭汜用贾诩之计。恰好长安城中马宇家僮，出首家主与刘范、种邵外连马腾、韩遂，欲为内应等情。李傕、郭汜大怒，尽收三家老少良贱，斩于市，把三颗首级直来门前号令。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毛甘> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "毛甘"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毛甘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "毛甘"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毛甘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毛甘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时歙县起义军首领，屯乌聊山，为吴将贺齐讨平。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭缊> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭缊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭缊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郭緼"@zh .
