<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沙末汗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末鲜卑首领。建安中，其父厥机死，被曹操立为亲汉王。延康初，又遣使向曹魏献马。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高承> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高承"@zh .
