<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高承> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙策部将。任五官掾。曾与奉正都尉刘由奉策命前往许昌，贡献方物。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊陵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "樊陵"@zh .
