<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈奉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "嘉禾三年（234），为校尉，随使者谢宏等至高句骊，拜句骊王宫为单于。"@zh .
