<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#育延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "鲜卑大人。魏略曰：鲜卑大人育延，常为州所畏，而一旦将其部落五千余骑诣习，求互市。习念不听则恐其怨，若听到州下，又恐为所略，于是乃许之往与会空城中交市。遂敕郡县，自将治中以下军往就之。市易未毕，市吏收缚一胡。延骑皆惊，上马弯弓围习数重，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜挚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜挚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜挚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "德鲁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜挚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜挚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "善文赋。初为司徒军谋吏。后举孝廉，任郎中，转补校书。有集二卷，今佚。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈应> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈应"@zh .
