<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#龚衡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "景耀中为领军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乌获> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "乌获"@zh .
