<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乌获> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "战国时秦国勇士。秦武王力大好戏耍，乌获等遂受宠。获与任鄙、孟说皆至大官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乌获> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "战国时秦国勇士。秦武王力大好戏耍，乌获等遂受宠。获与任鄙、孟说皆至大官。演义中有提及此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫固> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卫固"@zh .
