<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#云英> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "董承的侍妾，因与董承家奴秦庆童有染被发现而受到杖脊四十，秦庆童怀恨在心，向曹操告发了董承的玉带诏密谋，导致董承被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#狼岑> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "狼岑"@zh .
