<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱志> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "赤乌中为牙门将。八年（245），与征西将军马茂等合谋欲收缚公卿诸将，引兵入苑中击孙权，叛吴降魏。事泄伏诛，夷三族。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张氏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張氏"@zh .
