<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张温中妹有节行，先适顾承，官以许嫁丁氏，成婚有日，饮药而死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#师宜官> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "师宜官"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#师宜官> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "师宜官"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#师宜官> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#师宜官> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "书法家。汉灵帝好书法，世多能者，而师宜官为最。每书毕，辄削焚其稿。梁鹄灌醉宜官后窃其书札，临摹练习，曹操以为胜过宜官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#和郁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "和郁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#和郁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "和鬱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#和郁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#和郁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "和峤同母弟。素无名，峤轻侮之。后郁以公强当世，致位尚书令。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董卓> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "董卓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董卓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲颖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董卓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董卓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "早年为汉将，在西方平定少数民族叛乱，后来又参加讨伐黄巾起义，数次兵败，却依然升为前将军，掌管重兵。董卓拥兵自重，驻兵于河东，不肯接受朝廷的征召而放弃兵权，正逢京都大乱，何进被杀，董卓趁机进京，控制了中央政权。之后董卓废汉少帝，立汉献帝..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董卓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "原为汉河东太守，征讨黄巾不利，却因贿赂十常侍官至西凉刺史。董卓应大将军何进之邀进京铲除宦官，恰逢何进被杀，于是收编何进部曲，又赠赤兔马给吕布，诱其投降并杀死荆州刺史丁原，从此不可一世。董卓废汉少帝，立汉献帝，朝臣多敢怒不敢言；董卓生性..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯湛> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯湛"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯湛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孝若"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯湛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯湛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "夏侯渊之后。文章宏富，善构新词。美容貌。京都称其与潘岳为“连璧”。晋武帝泰始（265-274）中举贤良对策，中第，拜郎中。惠帝时为散骑常侍。性颇侈豪。著论三十余篇。元康（291-299）初卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀禹> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀禹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀禹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "荀禹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀禹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀禹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任治书侍御史。黄初七年（226）孙权攻江夏郡，太守文聘坚守，禹被派往慰劳。禹至，于江夏发所经县兵及所从步骑千人乘山举火，孙权遂退走。"@zh .
