<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李贵人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏文帝曹丕夫人。生子曹协。黄初中，与郭后、阴贵人并受曹丕爱幸；致甄后遂有怨言而被赐死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#隗渠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "隗渠"@zh .
