<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许章> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "皇甫谧逸士传曰：汝南王儁，字子文，少为范滂、许章所识，与南阳岑晊善。"@zh .
