<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李基> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "李通之子。建安中，通死于军旅，基袭爵都亭侯。曹丕即位，诏拜奉义中郎降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹上> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹上"@zh .
