<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王晨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "王淩叔父允，为汉司徒，诛董卓。卓将李傕、郭汜等为卓报仇，入长安，杀允，尽害其家。凌及兄晨，时年皆少，逾城得脱，亡命归乡里。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#敬怀皇后> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "敬怀皇后"@zh .
