<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏衡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "酒泉苏衡反，与羌豪邻戴及丁令胡万余骑攻边县。既与夏侯儒击破之，衡及邻戴等皆降。"@zh .
