<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#仇昭仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏文帝曹丕夫人。生东海定王霖。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨虑> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨虑"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨虑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "威方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨虑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨虑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少有德行，为江南冠冕。州郡礼召，诸公辟请，皆不能屈。年十七，夭，乡人号曰德行杨君。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#路粹> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "路粹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#路粹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文蔚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#路粹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#路粹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少学于蔡邕。建安初拜为尚书郎，后为军谋祭酒，典记室。孔融有过，曹操使粹为奏，融诛。人无不畏其笔，转秘书令，坐违禁诛。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#路粹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孔融在推荐祢衡的表中提及了此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于兹> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "于兹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于兹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "于兹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于兹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于兹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "下邳相笮融部将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王翁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王翁"@zh .
