<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#霍显> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#霍显> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏明帝青龙元年（233），并州刺史毕轨送汉故度辽将军范明友鲜卑奴。此奴年三百五十岁，言语饮食如常人，自言名霍显，乃霍光后小妻。又言明友妻为霍光前妻女。"@zh .
