<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩晞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙策攻黄祖，表遣从子刘虎及晞率长矛军五千救黄祖。及与孙策战，败，被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高顺> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高顺"@zh .
