<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘本> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "学者。师受经传，博学群书。举贤良方正，为般长，卒于官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏延> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "魏延"@zh .
