<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨密> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "郭汜部将。是时，郭汜议欲攻李傕，杨彪进言反对，汜怒，欲手刃之，中郎将密及左右多谏，汜乃归之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨密> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "杨彪曰：“一劫天子，一劫公卿，意欲何为？”汜大怒，便拔剑欲杀彪。中郎将杨密力劝，汜乃放了杨彪、朱隽，其余都监在营中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜锡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜锡"@zh .
