<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜锡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为长沙王司马乂文学。后历太子中舍人、卫将军长史、治书御史等。官至尚书左丞。年四十八死，赠散骑常侍。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#商汤> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "商汤"@zh .
