<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#商汤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "商朝的创建者（约前1617年—前1588年在位）儒家推崇的上古圣王之一，在位30年，其中17年为部落首领，13年为商朝君主。姓子，名履，今人多称商汤，甲骨文称啺（音“唐”，为甲骨文的“唐”字）、大乙、太乙，又称高祖乙，原商族部落首领，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#商汤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "商朝时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐晃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐晃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐晃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公明"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐晃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐晃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "原为军阀杨奉的部下任骑都尉。曹操击败杨奉后投靠曹操。参加过多次重大作战，智勇双全，战功卓著，治军有方。曹操曾称赞徐晃：“徐将军可谓有周亚夫之风矣。”在曹操军中历任裨将军、偏将军、横野将军、平寇将军。官渡之战中烧毁袁绍的后勤粮草有功，加..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐晃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初从杨奉，善使大斧，武艺过人，曾助奉救驾，败郭汜。后太祖与杨奉相争，甚爱晃才，遂遣满宠说徐晃来降。晃随曹操南征北战，平吕布，灭袁绍，战马超，降张鲁，多有战功。关羽围樊城，徐晃奉命解围，先败关平，与曹仁里应外合，大败关羽。魏建，降将孟达..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹协> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹协"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹协> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹協"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹协> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹协> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹丕之子。太和五年（231），追封谥曰经殇公。青龙二年（234），更追改号谥曰赞哀王。"@zh .
