<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘弘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘弘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "先为光禄勋，灵帝中平六年（189），迁司空。同年八月，董卓自为司空，弘被免职。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文丑> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "文丑"@zh .
