<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#殷纯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾任大司马属。建安二十五年（220），与刘豹、张裔等劝刘备即皇帝位。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶丘一> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陶丘一"@zh .
