<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏王公。文帝之子。黄初二年（221）封秦公，以京兆郡为国。三年，改为京兆王。六年，改封元城王。太和三年（229）卒，谥曰哀王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张邈> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张邈"@zh .
