<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华周> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "华歆少子。博学有才思，历官黄门侍郎、常山太守。中年遇疾，卒于家。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#费恭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "费恭"@zh .
