<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#费恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "费祎之子。尚公主，为尚书郎，显名当世，早卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜轸> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜轸"@zh .
