<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜轸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜轸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "杜雄之子。师事学者谯周，博涉经书。州辟不就，任郡功曹史。入晋后，官至犍为太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张咸> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张咸"@zh .
