<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张咸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "凤凰元年（272），为江陵督。时晋将羊祜攻江陵，咸固守，祜不能拔。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李绪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李绪"@zh .
