<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐矫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权徐夫人兄。父徐琨死后，袭封为广德侯。后讨平山越，拜偏将军。死后无子，弟徐祚袭其封。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵咨> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵咨"@zh .
