<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵咨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵咨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "董卓之乱，与同县司马朗奔黎阳。后仕魏为尚书。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄黄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "甄黄"@zh .
