<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄黄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏文帝甄皇后母家从孙。早卒。明帝爱女曹淑死，追封平原懿公主，取甄黄柩与之合葬。追封黄列侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘略> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘略"@zh .
