<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宗玮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任太中大夫。刘备章武二年（222）冬，孙权闻备住白帝，甚懼，遣使请和。备许之，遣玮报命。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟贲> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孟贲"@zh .
