<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华当> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华当> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安八年（203），率民众万户屯汉兴，为孙权部将贺齐讨破，出降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁迪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁迪"@zh .
