<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱盖> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱盖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱盖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "朱蓋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱盖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱盖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操部属。建安二十四年（219），曹仁和关羽战于樊城，曹操命徐晃率军助战，与关羽相持不下。曹操又先后派遣他和殷署等，率十二营兵马增援徐晃。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙闿> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙闿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙闿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫闓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙闿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙闿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙綝之弟。吴帝孙亮亲政，綝称疾不朝，而以诸弟分屯诸营，控制局势。孙綝废亮后，迎立孙休为帝，綝及其四弟恩、据、干、闿皆任要职，握重兵，出现了“一门五侯”的局面。闿曾任长水校尉，后被封为亭侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙闿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "（孙亮）虽然聪明，却被孙綝把持，不能主张，綝令弟威远将军孙据入苍龙宿卫，武卫将军孙恩、偏将军孙干、长水校尉孙闿分屯诸营。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘汉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘汉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘汉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲嘏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘汉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘汉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "历右司马、吏部尚书、光禄大夫等官，为一时名流。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#燕荔阳> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "燕荔阳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#燕荔阳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "燕荔陽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#燕荔阳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#燕荔阳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉鲜卑族首领。安帝时，他到洛阳朝贺，汉赐“鲜卑王”印绶，赤车参驾。与汉人进行贸易活动，保持友好关系。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#栈潜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "栈潜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#栈潜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彦皇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#栈潜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#栈潜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "《三国志》魏书载：景初年间，栈潜，太祖时历任县令。后被任命为燕中尉，他推辞有病未就任，去世。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹则> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹则"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹则> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹則"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹则> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹则> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹真之子。真卒，封为列侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张辽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张辽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张辽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文远"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张辽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张辽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "以武力过人被召为从事。先后从属丁原、董卓、吕布，及至吕布败后才归于曹操。从曹操以后，辽随军征讨，多有战功，与关羽解白马之围，围降昌豨于东海，攻袁尚于邺城，斩乌丸单于蹋顿于白狼山，又讨平梅成、陈兰贼寇。赤壁战后，曹操留张辽、乐进、李典等..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张辽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "面如紫玉，目若朗星。初为吕布部将，数令曹操陷于苦战，武勇亦为关羽所称道。后吕布亡，曹操听刘备、关羽之劝，待张辽以上礼，遂降。以后张辽随军征讨，多有战功，曹操亦待之如亲信。曹操围关羽时张辽成功劝关羽降。赤壁败，张辽亲载曹操脱难，并射伤权..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙权> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙权"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙权> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲谋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙权> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙权> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙坚之子，孙策之弟。东汉建安五年，兄孙策病死，孙权继位吴侯、讨逆将军，领会稽太守，开始统领江东。他击败了黄祖。后东吴联合刘备，于赤壁击溃了曹操军。东吴后来又和曹操军在合肥附近鏖战，并从刘备手中夺回荆州、杀死关羽、大破刘备的讨伐军。曹丕..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙权> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙权19岁就继承了其兄孙策之位，力据江东，击败了黄祖。后东吴联合刘备，在赤壁大战击溃了曹操军。东吴后来又和曹操军在合肥附近鏖战，并从刘备手中夺回荆州、杀死关羽、大破刘备的讨伐军。曹丕称帝后孙权先向北方称臣，后自己建吴称帝，迁都建业。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘节> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘节"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘节> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉節"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘节> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘节> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "豪族。为郡主簿，宾客千余家，不让其家客王同徭役，扰乱吏治。为菅长司马芝所奏，最后被迫代家客服役。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹嘉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "尹嘉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹嘉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "尹嘉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹嘉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹嘉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任禄福长时，因钦佩烈女庞娥为报父仇杀李寿，解印绶纵娥亡去。后娥会赦得免。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#镡承> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "镡承"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#镡承> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公文"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#镡承> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#镡承> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "历官郡守、少府。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王澄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王澄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王澄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "平子"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王澄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王澄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太尉武陵侯王衍弟。少历显位，任成都王颖从事中郎。及颖败，东海王越请为司空长史，封南乡侯。惠帝末，为荆州刺史。元帝继位，征澄为军谘祭酒，赴召时，为王敦手下力士所杀，年四十四。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲜于嗣> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "鲜于嗣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲜于嗣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鮮于嗣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲜于嗣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲜于嗣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任乐浪太守。明帝景初中，命其与刘昕越海定带方、乐浪二郡。赐韩国君臣邑君、邑长印缀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜牧> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜牧"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜牧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "牧之"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜牧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜牧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "号樊川。晚唐著名诗人和古文家。擅长长篇五言古诗和七律。曾任中书舍人（中书省别名紫微省），人称杜紫微。其诗英发俊爽，为文尤纵横奥衍，多切经世之务，在晚唐成就颇高，时人称其为“小杜”，以别于杜甫；又与李商隐齐名，人称“小李杜”。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜牧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "晚唐时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹操> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹操"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹操> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孟德"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹操> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹操> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "政治家、军事家、诗人，统一了北方、挟天子以令诸侯，戎马一生。曹操父亲曹嵩为宦官曹腾养子，曹腾为汉相曹参之后。曹操谥武王，曹丕称帝后，追尊他为武皇帝，史称魏武帝。曹操在北方屯田，兴修水利，解决了军粮缺乏的问题，对农业生产的恢复有一定作用..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹操> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹操是西园八校尉之一，曾只身行刺董卓，失败后和袁绍共同联合天下诸侯讨伐董卓，后独自发展自身势力，一生中先后战胜了袁术、吕布、张绣、袁绍、刘表、张鲁、马超等割据势力，统一了北方。但是在南下讨伐江东的战役中，曹操在赤壁惨败。后来在和蜀汉的..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#貂蝉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "貂蝉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#貂蝉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "貂蟬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#貂蝉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#貂蝉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自民间传说。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#貂蝉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "舍身报国的可敬女子，她为了挽救天下黎民，为了推翻权臣董卓的荒淫统治，受王允所托，上演了可歌可泣的连环计（连环美人计），周旋于两个男人之间，成功的离间了董卓和吕布，最终吕布将董卓杀死，结束了董卓专权的黑暗时期。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王廙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王廙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王廙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王廙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王廙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王廙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "是岁基薨，追赠司空，谥曰景侯。子徽嗣，早卒。咸熙中，开建五等，以基著勋前朝，改封基孙廙，而以东武余邑赐一子爵关内侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁礼> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁礼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "袁禮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任中书郎。初孙权信任酷吏吕壹，后吕壹奸露伏诛，权乃使礼告谢诸大将，引咎自责。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟武> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孟武"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孟武"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏曹丕文德郭皇后姊子。曾还乡里，求小妻，为后劝止。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔瑷> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "崔瑷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔瑷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子玉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔瑷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔瑷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "文学家、书法家。崔骃之子。早孤，锐志好学。年十八，至京师，从侍中贾逵质正大义，遂精通天文、历数、《京房易传》等。因为兄报仇，杀人而逃至他方，会赦，归家。年四十余，始为郡吏。后几为贵戚吏，皆不遇被斥。举茂才，迁汲令。在事数言便宜，为人开..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯氏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯氏"@zh .
