<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沈珩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少综贯经艺，尤善《春秋》内外传。初任西曹掾，孙权以为有智谋，能专对，乃使至魏，随事应答魏文帝，无所屈服。以奉使敏达而获得声誉，封永安乡侯，官至少府。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王隆> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王隆"@zh .
