<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵达> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时魏官吏。任校事。执法多以爱憎。后奸事发，被曹操处死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵温> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵温"@zh .
