<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈桃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "又臣郡吏陈桃梦臣与道士相遇，放发被鹿裘，布易六爻，挠其三以饮臣，臣乞尽吞之。"@zh .
