<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李兴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "历任别驾、参军、太傅掾。惠帝永兴中，镇南将军刘弘命他撰诸葛亮、羊祜碣文。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐顾> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐顾"@zh .
