<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐顾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "其所驻屯之地与吕蒙营相比邻。顾死，吴主孙权欲以其众并入吕蒙军中，吕蒙坚辞不受，认为顾为国辛劳，他死后应该让其子弟为将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沮宗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "沮宗"@zh .
