<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沮宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "沮授弟。官渡之战前夕，授知绍必败而散其资产，宗却认为曹操兵马不敌绍。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关羽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "关羽"@zh .
