<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄疆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "嘉禾二年（233），以中使随太常张弥、执金吾许晏出使辽东，拜公孙渊为燕王，被渊拘留。后逃归吴，孙权以为校尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马超> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马超"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马超> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孟起"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马超> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马超> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "马腾遣马超随钟繇讨郭援于平阳，马超为飞矢所中，乃以布带裹好受伤的小腿继续战斗，终破袁军。马腾入朝为卫尉，拜马超为偏将军，封都亭侯，代领其众。关中之战时曾追击为渡河的己军而殿后的曹操，其骑兵箭下如雨，但为许褚保护曹操才得免于难；也多次以..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马超> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "五虎上将之一。十七岁时随父马腾、韩遂袭长安，杀李傕将李蒙、王方。曹操因马腾参与血衣诏而诱杀马腾，马超和韩遂举西凉兵报仇，于渭南大破曹操，杀至他割须弃袍；酣战许褚。因贾诩的离间之计，韩遂降曹，马超战败。卷土重来的马超破凉州州治冀城，但因..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程祁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "程祁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程祁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公弘"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程祁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程祁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "程畿之子。与杨戏等并知名，诸葛亮深识之。年二十而卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞统> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "庞统"@zh .
