<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵敦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵敦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "仕蜀任县令。曾绘常播像，并赞颂之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王彧> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王彧"@zh .
