<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王彧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "兖州刺史刘岱手下任别驾之职，曾推荐程昱于岱。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯愔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "冯愔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯愔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "馮愔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯愔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯愔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘玄更始时，邓禹西征，以愔为积弩将军。建武元年（25）禹命愔与车骑将军宗歆守栒邑。二人争权相攻，遂杀歆，因反击禹。愔后为护军黄防所执，愔至洛阳，赦不诛。二年，随禹西击赤眉，屯云阳，又引兵叛禹。西向天水，被隗嚣逆击，破之于高平，尽获辎重。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张京> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张京"@zh .
