<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张京> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安年间曾为军祭酒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢斐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "谢斐"@zh .
