<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#扶罗韩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#扶罗韩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末鲜卑大人。鲜卑王步度根兄，拥众数万别立。建安中，为大人轲比能所杀，部众悉属轲比能。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#召公奭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "召公奭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#召公奭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "召公奭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#召公奭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#召公奭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "姬姓，名奭。周文王之子，周武王、周公旦之同父异母弟。食邑于召（今陕西歧山西南），曾辅助周武王灭商，被封于燕（今河北北部），都城在蓟（今北京），但并未前往，由长子克前往就任，是后来燕国和召国的始祖。召公奭是周初活跃时间最长的政治家，历经..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#召公奭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西周时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文雍> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "文雍"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文雍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文雍"@zh .
