<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#殷署> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾任平南将军，随赵俨大破羌军。关羽围曹仁于樊，署奉命于徐晃之后驰援，终解仁围。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭常子> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭常子"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭常子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郭常子"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭常子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭常子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭常子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "关羽过五关斩六将后，寻找其兄长刘备。路遇大雨，于一老人家里借宿，此老人即为郭常。其子不务正业，半夜偷盗赤兔马，被人抓住，关羽看在郭常的面子上饶了他。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马徽童子> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马徽童子"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马徽童子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "司馬徽童子"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马徽童子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马徽童子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国演义中的虚构角色。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马徽童子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司马徽的徒弟，遇到马跃檀溪后的刘备，将其引致司马徽处。"@zh .
