<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成藩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建兴中为督军。建兴九年（231），诸葛亮出祁山攻魏，中都护李平催督运军资。时值天雨，运粮不继，李平遣藩与参军狐忠喻旨诸葛亮退军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吉黄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吉黄"@zh .
