<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吉黄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吉茂孪生兄。任长陵令。时科禁长吏擅去官，他听到司徒赵温死，因自己是其故吏，遂违科奔丧，被司隶校尉钟繇逮捕，伏法。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#野王君> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "野王君"@zh .
