<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱淑媛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱淑媛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏文帝曹丕夫人。生东武阳怀王曹鉴。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁昭公> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "鲁昭公"@zh .
