<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁昭公> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁昭公> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "鲁国之二十六代君主。前542年即位，前517年，鲁昭公伐季孙氏，但大败，鲁昭公逃到齐国，前510年，昭公死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁昭公> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "春秋时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#和逌> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "和逌"@zh .
