<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#仲兴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹节次子，曹腾兄。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#楚义帝> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "楚义帝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#楚义帝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楚義帝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#楚义帝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#楚义帝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "战国时楚怀王熊槐之孙，楚亡后，隐匿民间为人牧羊。项梁起事，采纳范增的建议，自称武信君并立熊心为楚怀王，以从民望。项梁在定陶败死，怀王以宋义为上将军，项羽为次将，率兵救赵。又令刘邦西向略地入关。与诸将约，先入关中者王之。项羽杀宋义，在钜..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#楚义帝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "后楚怀王，名熊心，是战国末期楚怀王熊槐的孙子。秦二世二年（前208年）夏六月，被楚地反秦义军首领项梁等拥立为王，仍号“楚怀王”。三国演义中有提及此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#万秉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "万秉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#万秉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "萬秉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#万秉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#万秉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末黄巾起义首领。秉坚持斗争，直到建安年间才被孙权部朱治率兵平息。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲜于银> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "鲜于银"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲜于银> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鮮于銀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲜于银> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲜于银> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "事刘虞为骑都尉。公孙瓒败虞，获之，胁段训杀虞。银等举州兵欲为虞报仇，共推阎柔为乌丸司马，迎虞子和，与袁绍将曲义合兵共击瓒，瓒败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#广阳顺王> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "广阳顺王"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#广阳顺王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "廣陽順王"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#广阳顺王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#广阳顺王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "应为“广阳顷王”，汉皇族。三国时魏官吏刘放远祖。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#东里衮> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "东里衮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#东里衮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "東裏衮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#东里衮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#东里衮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任南阳太守。建安二十四年（219），宛守将侯音等反，囚衮。后被释。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#葛雍> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "葛雍"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#葛雍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "葛雍"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#葛雍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#葛雍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#葛雍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "毌丘俭先锋。俭反，司马师兴兵讨之。俭先锋葛雍曰：“南顿之地，依山傍水，极好屯兵；若魏兵先占，难以驱遣，可速取之。”俭然之。待到南顿时，司马师部将王基已先在此下寨。后在项城与邓艾战，被艾斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀靖> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀靖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀靖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔慈"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀靖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀靖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "隐士。荀彧叔父。少有俊才，隐居终身不仕。号玄行先生。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈琮> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈琮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈琮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公琰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈琮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈琮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉末汝阴太守，其兄陈瑀与袁术交恶，公琰请和于术，为术所执。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐庶> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐庶"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐庶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元直"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐庶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐庶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "年少时爱好任侠击剑，后折节向学，因中原战乱，客居于荆州，与诸葛亮、司马徽、庞统等人相友善。后徐庶效力于刘备，还推荐了诸葛亮。长坂之战时，徐庶的母亲被曹军抓获，于是徐庶北投曹操，在魏官至右中郎将、御史中丞。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐庶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中又为单福。年少时爱好击剑，后折节向学，游学四方。刘备在新野时，徐庶化名单福，投效与刘备，被拜为军师。徐庶为刘备出谋划策，击败曹将吕旷、吕翔，斗阵胜曹仁，并计取樊城。不久曹操手下谋士程昱识破了徐庶的身份，称徐庶之才十倍于己。曹操欲..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑小同> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑小同"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑小同> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子真"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑小同> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑小同> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "著名学者郑玄孙。学综六经，初为郎中，累迁至侍中，封关内侯，高贵乡公甘露三年（258），拜为五更。后为大将军司马昭鸩杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈堪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈堪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈堪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陳堪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈堪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈堪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "西晋官吏，陈准从弟。时有张子并、陈梁甫能书。甫恨逋，并恨峻，象斟酌其间，甚得其妙，中国善书者不能及也。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓氏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "桓氏"@zh .
