<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "对本郡严干、李义很赏识，认为他们各有器实。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#灵怀皇后> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "灵怀皇后"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#灵怀皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "靈懷皇后"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#灵怀皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#灵怀皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "即王美人，生汉献帝。祖父王苞为五官中郎将。王美人姿色秀丽，聪敏有才明，能书会计，以良家子的身份选入掖庭。当时灵帝的皇后何氏“性强忌，后宫莫不震慑”。王美人怀孕后，畏惧何皇后，服药欲堕胎，而胎安不动，又数次梦到负日而行。光和四年（公元1..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#灵怀皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "即王美人，生汉献帝。帝宠幸王美人，生皇子协。何后嫉妒，鸩杀王美人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何仪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "何仪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "何儀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汝南、颍川处的黄巾军将领，聚众数万，先是响应袁术，后又依附孙坚，最终被曹操击败，率众投降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "黄巾军余党，被曹操率兵击败，逃跑途中为聚众自守的许褚所擒。后许褚归顺曹操，献出何仪，何仪即被处斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞延> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "庞延"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "龐延"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "为张既所礼辟，终有名位。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁广> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "梁广"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁广> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "梁廣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁广> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁广> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙亮时，曾与韦曜、周昭、薛莹、华覈等共撰吴国史。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#史璜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "史璜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#史璜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "史璜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#史璜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#史璜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "朱符死后，汉遣张津为交州刺史，津后又为其将区景所杀，而荆州牧刘表遣零陵赖恭代津。是时苍梧太守史璜死，表又遣吴巨代之，与恭俱至。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阴贵人> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阴贵人"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阴贵人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陰貴人"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阴贵人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阴贵人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏文帝曹丕夫人。黄初初年，与郭贵嫔等并为文帝所爱幸，致使元妃甄氏有怨言而被赐死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#和峤> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "和峤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#和峤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "长舆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#和峤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#和峤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "和逌子。盛名于世。魏末为颍川太守，有政绩。晋武帝时任给事黄门侍郎、中书令，常与帝共车入朝。惠帝时拜太子少傅，加散骑常侍、光禄大夫。死后追谥简，家产富于王者，人以为有钱癖。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#轲比能> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "轲比能"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#轲比能> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "軻比能"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#轲比能> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#轲比能> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉末三国时期的鲜卑民族的杰出首领，由于他作战勇敢，执法公平，不贪财物，所以被鲜卑民众推举为大人。他的部落近塞，所以他抓住有利条件积极学习汉族先进技术和文化，促进了鲜卑族的进步和北方的民族融合。他统率下的部众，战守有法，战斗力相当强大。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#轲比能> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "鮮卑王。呼應曹丕五路進攻蜀漢的計劃，與羌兵一同出征。知道對手是令異族聞風喪膽的“神威將軍”馬超後，便不戰而自行逃回。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#云午> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "云午"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#云午> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "雲午"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#云午> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#云午> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时魏优人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王恂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王恂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王恂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "良夫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王恂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王恂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父肃，魏侍中，太常。肃死，魏元帝景元四年（263），封恂兰陵侯，咸熙中，改封氶子。恂为晋武帝母舅，历官河南尹、侍中。武帝咸宁四年（278）卒，年四十余。赠车骑将军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#灌均> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "灌均"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#灌均> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "灌均"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#灌均> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#灌均> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "为监国谒者。黄初二年（221），均奏曹植过，曹丕贬植为安乡侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李休> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李休"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李休> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子郎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李休> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李休> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "居南郑，为镇北将军张鲁的司马。张鲁败，曹操因休曾劝张鲁投降，赐爵关内侯，署散官骑从。黄初中，历上党、钜鹿太守，后以年老还，拜议郎。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李邵（蜀）> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李邵（蜀）"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李邵（蜀）> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "永南"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李邵（蜀）> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李邵（蜀）> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘备据蜀后，任州书佐部从事。建兴元年（223），诸葛亮辟为丞相府西曹掾。诸葛亮南征，留守为治中从事，是年卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁敞> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁敞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁敞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔平"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁敞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁敞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁安之子。少传《易经》，因父任为太子舍人。和帝时任东郡太守，征拜太仆光禄勋，迁司空。敞廉洁刚毅，不阿权贵。因失外戚邓氏旨而自杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑舒> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑舒"@zh .
