<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡喜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "以开济为称，官至凉州刺史、建武将军、假节、护羌校尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#应劭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "应劭"@zh .
