<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#应劭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少笃学，博览多闻。灵帝时举孝廉。中平六年（189），拜泰山太守。献帝兴平元年（194），曹操父、弟在其辖境内被杀，劭惧操报复，弃官投奔袁绍。任军谋校尉。后卒于邺。劭著有《汉官礼仪故事》、《状人纪》、《中汉辑序》、《风俗通》、《汉书集解..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#应劭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "自是，曹操部下，文有谋臣，武有猛将，威镇山东。乃遣泰山太守应劭往瑯琊郡取父曹嵩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毛嘉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "毛嘉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毛嘉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "毛嘉"@zh .
