<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毛嘉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时魏明帝皇后毛氏之父。太和元年（227）拜骑都尉。后封博平乡侯，迁光禄大夫。青龙三年（235）卒，改封安国侯，谥曰节侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏固> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "苏固"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏固> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蘇固"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏固> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏固> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "益州牧刘焉以鲁为督义司马，与别部司马张脩将兵击汉中太守苏固，鲁遂袭脩杀之，夺其众。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘乔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘乔"@zh .
