<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "靖虽年逾七十，爱乐人物，诱纳后进，清谈不倦。丞相诸葛亮皆为之拜。章武二年卒。子钦，先靖夭没。钦子游，景耀中为尚书。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柴玉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "柴玉"@zh .
